{
  "__inputs": [
    {
      "name": "DS_VICTORIAMETRICS",
      "label": "VictoriaMetrics",
      "type": "datasource",
      "pluginId": "prometheus"
    }
  ],
  "__requires": [
    {
      "type": "grafana",
      "id": "grafana",
      "name": "Grafana",
      "version": "11.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "datasource",
      "id": "prometheus",
      "name": "Prometheus",
      "version": "1.0.0"
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "stat",
      "name": "Stat",
      "version": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "timeseries",
      "name": "Time series",
      "version": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "barchart",
      "name": "Bar chart",
      "version": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "piechart",
      "name": "Pie chart",
      "version": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "table",
      "name": "Table",
      "version": ""
    },
    {
      "type": "panel",
      "id": "text",
      "name": "Text",
      "version": ""
    }
  ],
  "uid": "copilot-cohorts",
  "title": "Copilot \u2014 Adoption Cohorts",
  "description": "AI adoption phase distribution, cohort migration, and user lists per phase.",
  "tags": [
    "copilot",
    "cohorts",
    "adoption"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "1h",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-90d",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "enterprise",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(github_copilot_daily_active_users, enterprise)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": false,
        "includeAll": false,
        "label": "Enterprise",
        "current": {}
      },
      {
        "name": "cohort",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": {
          "type": "prometheus",
          "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
        },
        "query": "label_values(github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\"}, ai_adoption_phase)",
        "refresh": 2,
        "multi": true,
        "includeAll": true,
        "label": "Cohort (Phase)",
        "current": {
          "selected": true,
          "text": "All",
          "value": "$__all"
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "About This Dashboard",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Copilot Adoption Cohorts\n\nThis dashboard tracks how developers across the enterprise are progressing through Copilot adoption phases. Data is collected daily by the exact-diff exporter from GitHub's API.\n\n**Use the Enterprise dropdown** to select your enterprise. **Use the Cohort dropdown** to filter all panels to one or more specific phases.\n\n---\n\n### Phase Definitions\n\n| Phase | What it means |\n|---|---|\n| **No Cohort** | The user has a Copilot seat but has not been assigned to a cohort by GitHub. This typically means the user has no usage history in the reporting window, or GitHub has not yet classified them. These are your primary activation targets. |\n| **Phase 1** | Early adopters \u2014 users who have begun using at least one Copilot feature. They are exploring the product but usage may be infrequent or limited to a single surface such as completions. |\n| **Phase 2** | Developing users \u2014 users who are using Copilot more regularly across at least one feature. They show consistent engagement and are building the habit of AI-assisted development. |\n| **Phase 3** | Power users \u2014 users who demonstrate sustained, multi-feature engagement with Copilot. They use completions, chat, and likely CLI or agent features regularly. These are your internal champions. |\n| **unknown** | The phase value was present in the GitHub API response but did not match a known phase label. This may indicate a new phase category introduced by GitHub that has not yet been mapped. |\n\n---\n\n**Sections:** Phase Counts | Phase Distribution and Trends | Weekly Migration | Cohort Activity | User Lists by Phase"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Phase Counts",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 9
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "No Cohort",
      "description": "Users with a seat who have not yet been placed in an adoption cohort. These are your highest-priority activation targets \u2014 they have access to Copilot but are not using it. Source: github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{ai_adoption_phase='No Cohort'}.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 10
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"No Cohort\"}",
          "legendFormat": "No Cohort"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#9C5FE0"
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Phase 1",
      "description": "Early adopters who have begun using at least one Copilot feature. Usage may be infrequent or limited to a single surface. Source: github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{ai_adoption_phase='Phase 1'}.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 4,
        "y": 10
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"Phase 1\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Phase 1"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#F0954A"
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Phase 2",
      "description": "Developing users with more regular, consistent Copilot engagement across at least one feature. They are building the habit of AI-assisted development. Source: github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{ai_adoption_phase='Phase 2'}.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 10
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"Phase 2\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Phase 2"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#3B82E6"
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Phase 3",
      "description": "Power users with sustained, multi-feature Copilot engagement. These are your internal champions \u2014 ideal candidates for peer enablement and feedback. Source: github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{ai_adoption_phase='Phase 3'}.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 10
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"Phase 3\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Phase 3"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#5BA85B"
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Unknown",
      "description": "Users whose phase value was present in the GitHub API response but did not match a known phase label. May indicate a new phase category introduced by GitHub. Source: github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{ai_adoption_phase='unknown'}.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 16,
        "y": 10
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"unknown\"}",
          "legendFormat": "Unknown"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "fixed",
            "fixedColor": "#64748B"
          },
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Phase 3 Rate",
      "description": "Phase 3 users as a percentage of all users in any phase. A rising rate indicates the adoption programme is successfully deepening engagement. Target: above 20%.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 4,
        "w": 4,
        "x": 20,
        "y": 10
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"Phase 3\"} / clamp_min(sum(github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\"}), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "Phase 3 Rate"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "#E0524A",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "#F0954A",
                "value": 10
              },
              {
                "color": "#5BA85B",
                "value": 20
              }
            ]
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": {
          "calcs": [
            "lastNotNull"
          ]
        },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "textMode": "value_and_name"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 101,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Phase Distribution and Trends",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 14
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "Current Phase Distribution",
      "description": "Snapshot of how all users are distributed across cohort phases as of the most recent data point. A healthy enterprise shows a growing proportion of Phase 2 and Phase 3 users over time with a shrinking No Cohort segment.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 15
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=~\"$cohort\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{ai_adoption_phase}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "No Cohort"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#9C5FE0"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Phase 1"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#F0954A"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Phase 2"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3B82E6"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Phase 3"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#5BA85B"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "unknown"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#64748B"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "pieType": "donut",
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "table",
          "placement": "right",
          "values": [
            "value",
            "percent"
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Phase Population Over Time",
      "description": "How the count of users in each cohort phase has changed over the selected window. No Cohort declining while Phase 1, 2, and 3 rise is the target pattern. Filtered by the Cohort dropdown. Source: github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 16,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 15
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=~\"$cohort\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{ai_adoption_phase}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "lineWidth": 2
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "No Cohort"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#9C5FE0"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Phase 1"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#F0954A"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Phase 2"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3B82E6"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Phase 3"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#5BA85B"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "unknown"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#64748B"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 102,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Weekly Migration",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 10,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Weekly Phase Change",
      "description": "Week-over-week change in user count per phase. A negative No Cohort delta means more users left that phase (became Phase 1) than joined it. Positive Phase 2 and Phase 3 deltas confirm the enablement programme is working. Source: github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count offset 7d.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 25
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"No Cohort\"} - github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"No Cohort\"} offset 7d",
          "legendFormat": "No Cohort delta"
        },
        {
          "expr": "github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"Phase 1\"} - github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"Phase 1\"} offset 7d",
          "legendFormat": "Phase 1 delta"
        },
        {
          "expr": "github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"Phase 2\"} - github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"Phase 2\"} offset 7d",
          "legendFormat": "Phase 2 delta"
        },
        {
          "expr": "github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"Phase 3\"} - github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=\"Phase 3\"} offset 7d",
          "legendFormat": "Phase 3 delta"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "No Cohort delta"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#9C5FE0"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Phase 1 delta"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#F0954A"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Phase 2 delta"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#3B82E6"
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": {
              "id": "byName",
              "options": "Phase 3 delta"
            },
            "properties": [
              {
                "id": "color",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "fixed",
                  "fixedColor": "#5BA85B"
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 11,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Phase Coverage as Percentage of All Users",
      "description": "Each phase as a percentage of total users across all phases. Use this to track whether the composition is shifting toward higher engagement phases over time. Filtered by the Cohort dropdown. Source: github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count as proportion of sum.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 25
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "100 * github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=~\"$cohort\"} / clamp_min(sum(github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_user_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\"}), 1)",
          "legendFormat": "{{ai_adoption_phase}} %"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 10
          }
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 103,
      "type": "row",
      "title": "Cohort Activity",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 1,
        "w": 24,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 33
      },
      "collapsed": false
    },
    {
      "id": 12,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "Prompts by Phase",
      "description": "Total prompts per adoption phase. Phase 3 users typically generate disproportionately more prompts per user than Phase 1 or No Cohort users. Use the Cohort filter to compare specific phases. Source: github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_prompt_count.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 0,
        "y": 34
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${DS_VICTORIAMETRICS}"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum by (ai_adoption_phase) (increase(github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_prompt_count{enterprise=\"$enterprise\", ai_adoption_phase=~\"$cohort\"}[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{ai_adoption_phase}}"
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short"
        }
      },
      "options": {
        "orientation": "horizontal",
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 13,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "LOC Added by Phase",
      "description": "Lines of AI-generated code accepted per adoption phase. Comparing LOC per user across phases reveals whether higher-phase users get more value per interaction. Source: github_copilot_ai_adoption_phase_loc_added_sum.",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 9,
        "w": 8,
        "x": 8,
        "y": 34
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
